# LF everywhere, on every platform: the shell scripts and hooks must run
# unchanged under Git Bash on Windows (core.autocrlf is on there).
* text=auto eol=lf
# Vendored upstream files, and the files copied or extracted from them, are
# kept byte for byte (SHA256SUMS and the corpus check rely on it): no
# end-of-line conversion. Upstream LICENSE.txt has CRLF line ends.
artefacts/** -text
corpus/*/vefa/** -text
corpus/*/LICENSE.txt -text
crates/einvoice-validator/bundles/cen-ubl/ubl/** -text
crates/*/LICENSES/EUPL-1.2.txt -text
